# Outside the input contract (PLAN.md): which lane `elect.sync` elects is
# taken not to matter, and an election reads as its lowest lane. The
# store under `%tid.x == 1 and elected` reads as under lane 0's
# election, on no thread and never run, where lane 1, if elected,
# stores once.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/elect_lane.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	@%p3 st.global.b32 	[%rd2], %r1; // no thread | exec 0/CTA | global store [param_0] sectors/req 0 (ideal 0){{$}}
